<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of July 11, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						July 11  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  4,758  2,262   4,911</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 76     79     141</p>
<p>CCC						827    827     829</p>
<p>TOTAL					  5,661  3,168   5,881</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 17,607  9,307   4,806</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				200    195     113</p>
<p>CCC					    2,558  2,558   1,887</p>
